# DrumMania V (drmnvj, Konami Python 2): e-AMUSEMENT switched on in test mode. Test, then MAIN MENU's
# NETWORK OPTIONS (Select R ten times, Start); on e-AMUSEMENT, Start held with Select R changes it
# to ON (ee'MALL appears); SAVE AND EXIT; the game asks for a reboot ("PLEASE TURN OFF THE SWITCH AND
# REBOOT"). The setting is on the disk: drmnvj-eamuse boots from this case's NVRAM folder.
game drmnvj
at 11000 press "Test" 8
at 11500 press "Select R" 8
at 11540 press "Select R" 8
at 11580 press "Select R" 8
at 11620 press "Select R" 8
at 11660 press "Select R" 8
at 11700 press "Select R" 8
at 11740 press "Select R" 8
at 11780 press "Select R" 8
at 11820 press "Select R" 8
at 11860 press "Select R" 8
at 11940 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12090 press "Select R" 8
at 12150 press "1 Player Start" 50
at 12165 press "Select R" 8
at 12250 press "Select L" 8
at 12310 press "Select L" 8
at 12370 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12870 quit
at 12570 snap
at 12870 quit
